flowchart LR
  Capture[Photograph or choose menu] --> Review[Review names, categories and prices]
  Review -->|Correct text| Review
  Review -->|Confirm| Analyze[Choose axes and estimate taste]
  Analyze --> Explore[Explore shared menu state]
  Explore --> Menu[Menu margins]
  Explore --> Map[Taste atlas]
  Menu <--> Map
  Map --> Detail[Item detail and menu evidence]
  Menu --> Detail
  Detail -->|Save or remove| Tonight[Tonight shortlist]
  Detail -->|Pair it| Pair[Suggested item in another category]
  Pair --> Detail
  Tonight -->|Keep exploring| Explore
  Analyze -->|Insufficient evidence| Unplaced[Unplaced items remain in list]
  Unplaced --> Menu
  Capture -->|Permission denied| Picker[Choose a photo]
  Picker --> Review
